(6031187, 885471, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very clever. Lighting is maybe a bit harsh. I like dark stuff so what do I know, but I would have toned this down a bit. Great idea though. High marks.</td>', 'Very clever. Lighting is maybe a bit harsh. I like dark stuff so what do I know, but I would have toned this down a bit. Great idea though. High marks.', '2010-05-28 21:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
